"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit\n"

#: core/domain/chat/focus_analyzer.py:181
msgid ""
"Active Scene Focus — Immediate Narrative Event:\n"
"React directly and organically to the unfolding event or acute action described in [WORLD_INFO] and [CHAT_HISTORY]."
msgstr ""
"Enfoque de escena activo — Evento narrativo inmediato:\n"
"Reacciona de forma directa y orgánica al evento en curso o a la acción inmediata descrita en [WORLD_INFO] y [CHAT_HISTORY]."

#: core/domain/chat/focus_analyzer.py:162
msgid ""
"Active Scene Focus — Personal History & Intimacy:\n"
"The conversation centers on personal feelings, intimacy, or {character_name}'s past. Strictly honor {character_name}'s canon origin, sexual history, and intimacy traits defined in [CHARACTER_DEFINITION]. NEVER invent or admit to past sexual or romantic experiences that contradict [CHARACTER_DEFINITION], while allowing authentic emotional responses to the current moment."
msgstr ""
"Enfoque de escena activo — Historia personal e intimidad:\n"
"La conversación se centra en los sentimientos personales, la intimidad o el pasado de {character_name}. Respeta estrictamente el origen canónico, el historial sexual y los rasgos de intimidad de {character_name} definidos en [CHARACTER_DEFINITION]. NUNCA inventes ni admitas experiencias sexuales o románticas pasadas que contradigan [CHARACTER_DEFINITION], permitiendo a la vez respuestas emocionales auténticas al momento actual."

#: core/domain/chat/focus_analyzer.py:173
msgid ""
"Active Scene Focus — Environment & Exploration:\n"
"Pay close attention to the current location, sensory atmosphere, and {character_name}'s location preferences in [WORLD_INFO]."
msgstr ""
"Enfoque de escena activo — Entorno y exploración:\n"
"Presta mucha atención a la ubicación actual, la atmósfera sensorial y las preferencias de ubicación de {character_name} en [WORLD_INFO]."

#: core/domain/chat/focus_analyzer.py:189
msgid ""
"Active Scene Focus — World Lore & Background Knowledge:\n"
"Incorporate relevant facts and canon details from [RELEVANT_LOREBOOKS] and [RELEVANT_MEMORIES] naturally into {character_name}'s perspective."
msgstr ""
"Enfoque de escena activo — Saber del mundo y conocimiento de fondo:\n"
"Incorpora de forma natural hechos relevantes y detalles canónicos de [RELEVANT_LOREBOOKS] y [RELEVANT_MEMORIES] en la perspectiva de {character_name}."

